      "cooked": "<p>when i applied date (exp_start_date ) filter in task tree view then after removing date its taking old date in api</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/7/27f9cb6cac1e7c4ca86849e6777414d1ad5361c6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/27f9cb6cac1e7c4ca86849e6777414d1ad5361c6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/27f9cb6cac1e7c4ca86849e6777414d1ad5361c6_2_690x402.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5HDNQ48OgNvjAHNreNLHDFAEdmu\" width=\"690\" height=\"402\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/27f9cb6cac1e7c4ca86849e6777414d1ad5361c6_2_690x402.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/27f9cb6cac1e7c4ca86849e6777414d1ad5361c6_2_1035x603.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/27f9cb6cac1e7c4ca86849e6777414d1ad5361c6_2_1380x804.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F8FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1470×858 134 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>in task_tree.js i wrote<br>\nconst exp_start_date_field = treeview.page.fields_dict.exp_start_date;<br>\nif (exp_start_date_field) {<br>\nexp_start_date_field.df.onchange = () =&gt; {<br>\nconst val  = exp_start_date_field.get_value();<br>\ntreeview.args.exp_start_date = val;<br>\ntreeview.make_tree();<br>\n};<br>\n}</p>\n<p>and in get_children()<br>\ni added  if exp_start_date:<br>\nfilters.append([“exp_start_date”, “=”, exp_start_date])</p>",
